From: Adam Chang <hunghsia@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Feb 2026 02:52:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libc/string/arm: update string routines (string.h support)

---
 libc/string/arm/_memcpy.S      | 736 ---------------------------------
 libc/string/arm/arm-features.h |  59 +++
 libc/string/arm/memcpy.S       | 361 +++++++++++++---
 libc/string/arm/memmove.S      | 370 ++++++++++++++---
 libc/string/arm/memset.S       |   1 +
 5 files changed, 689 insertions(+), 838 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 libc/string/arm/_memcpy.S
 create mode 100644 libc/string/arm/arm-features.h

diff --git a/libc/string/arm/_memcpy.S b/libc/string/arm/_memcpy.S
deleted file mode 100644
index 2999e8e..0000000
--- a/libc/string/arm/_memcpy.S
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,736 +0,0 @@
